		"request": "probe.o: a .text (SHF_ALLOC|SHF_EXECINSTR), a .data (SHF_ALLOC|SHF_WRITE) holding the message, and a 1024-byte SHT_NOBITS .bss — three sections with three different permission sets",
		"request_hex": "",
		"response": "A program header table with at least one PT_LOAD; every one of those three sections inside some PT_LOAD; p_filesz <= p_memsz everywhere, with the .bss showing up as p_memsz - p_filesz; no PT_INTERP, no PT_DYNAMIC, and no two PT_LOADs covering the same address",
